== Scope
The certificates are sufficient, not necessary, and hold on a high-probability accuracy event. The Gaussian tracking study measures the conservatism of the recorded-score accounts; Lemma 2 is not evaluated for that tracker.

== Reproducibility
- [HystereticSelection_code.zip Code and data (zip)]: Julia 1.12.1 with pinned environments (CairoMakie 0.15.13, Distributions 0.25.129), predeclared seeds, test suites, archived score streams and all result files, with a README mapping every figure and table to its script.
- The cached audit reproduces Table I from the archived Monte Carlo score streams; removing the cache flag regenerates all streams.
- Supplementary video: 35 s Julia-rendered replay of the tracking study and the design test.
